# System health page. Never press Run fix / Run with password / Fix.
ipc panels settings about/health
wait 5
shot health
note H1 same top label/detail, groups, rows, dots and words as QML (check in each look).
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 30
wait 1
shot health-end
note H1 end of the page: same groups, rows and footer as QML.
ptr move 1100 600 sleep 200 scroll 0 -30
wait 1
ptr move 1330 400 sleep 300 glide 1330 400 100 click
shot health-checking
note H2 straight after clicking Check again: "Checking..." busy button, then the footer time updates. Button position is a guess: read from the health shot.
wait 3
shot health-checked
note H2 the checking is done and the footer time updated.
# MANUAL: H3 click Copy report then wl-paste | head -3: a report in the clipboard in both shells
# MANUAL: H4 if shown, "Don't show again" then "Show alerts"; click again to put it back
ipc panels close
